32-qi","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p045","quote":"因宦者豎刀以厚獻於桓公，亦有寵"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji032-018:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p045","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"宦者","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0126","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、自立、追稱及用稱分開；官位、爵等及制度未核處保持未分類。日期原表述不換算，死亡與後稱不自動結束官爵。工正明示受任，拒絕卿不另作持有。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji039-093","person_id":"cbr-p001123","surfaces":["豎刀"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p043","quote":"四十一年，秦穆公虜晉惠公，復歸之。是歲，管仲、隰朋皆卒。管仲病，桓公問曰：「群臣誰可相者？」管仲曰：「知臣莫如君。」公曰：「易牙如何？」對曰：「殺子以適君，非人情，不可。」公曰：「開方如何？」對曰：「倍親以適君，非人情，難近。」公曰：「豎刀如何？」對曰：「自宮以適君，非人情，難親。」管仲死，而桓公不用管仲言，卒近用三子，三子專權。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p054","quote":"至齊，齊桓公厚禮，而以宗女妻之，有馬二十乘，重耳安之。重耳至齊二歳而桓公卒，會豎刀等爲内亂，齊孝公之立，諸侯兵數至。留齊凡五歳。重耳愛齊女，毋去心。趙衰、咎犯乃於桑下謀行。齊女侍者在桑上聞之，以告其主。其主乃殺侍者，勸重耳趣行。重耳曰：「人生安樂，孰知其他！必死於此，不能去。」齊女曰：「子一國公子，窮而來此，數士者以子爲命。子不疾反國，報勞臣，而懷女德，竊爲子羞之。且不求，何時得功？」乃與趙衰等謀，醉重耳，載以行。行遠而覺，重耳大怒，引戈欲殺咎犯。咎犯曰：「殺臣成子，偃之願也。」重耳曰：「事不成，我食舅氏之肉。」咎犯曰：「事不成，犯肉腥臊，何足食！」乃止，遂行。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p043","text":"四十一年，秦穆公虜晉惠公，復歸之。是歲，管仲、隰朋皆卒。管仲病，桓公問曰：「群臣誰可相者？」管仲曰：「知臣莫如君。」公曰：「易牙如何？」對曰：「殺子以適君，非人情，不可。」公曰：「開方如何？」對曰：「倍親以適君，非人情，難近。」公曰：「豎刀如何？」對曰：「自宮以適君，非人情，難親。」管仲死，而桓公不用管仲言，卒近用三子，三子專權。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"秦穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"隰朋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"易牙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001121","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"開方","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001122","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"豎刀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001123","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"三子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"三子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p045","text":"四十三年。初，齊桓公之夫人三：曰王姬、徐姬、蔡姬，皆無子。桓公好內，多內寵，如夫人者六人，長衛姬，生無詭；少衛姬，生惠公元；鄭姬，生孝公昭；葛嬴，生昭公潘；密姬，生懿公商人；宋華子，生公子雍。桓公與管仲屬孝公於宋襄公，以為太子。雍巫有寵於衛共姬，因宦者豎刀以厚獻於桓公，亦有寵，桓公許之立無詭。管仲卒，五公子皆求立。冬十月乙亥，齊桓公卒。易牙入，與豎刀因內寵殺群吏，而立公子無詭為君。太子昭奔宋。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"王姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001124","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"徐姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001125","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"蔡姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001116","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"長衛姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001126","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"無詭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001132","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"少衛姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001127","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"惠公元","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001133","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"鄭姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001128","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m045-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface